---
import OmarLayout from '../layouts/OmarLayout.astro';
---
<OmarLayout title="Contact" description="Talk to Omar about an AI project, an automation, a research question or a professional opportunity.">
  <section class="page-intro"><p class="eyebrow">Contact / 06</p><h1>What are you<br />working on?</h1><p class="lede">A project, a question, a workflow that takes too long. Tell me where you are and what you’re trying to figure out.</p></section>
  <section class="section booking-layout"><aside class="booking-summary"><p class="eyebrow">Start a conversation</p><h2>A useful first message.</h2><p>You don’t need a polished brief. A little context and a clear question are enough.</p><div class="detail-list"><div><h3>For projects</h3><p>The problem, the current tools and what a useful outcome would look like.</p></div><div><h3>For research</h3><p>The question, paper or opportunity you would like to discuss.</p></div></div><a href="mailto:omerapoua0@gmail.com">omerapoua0@gmail.com ↗</a><p>Looking for maths or science support? <a href="/tutoring.html">Start a lesson enquiry instead ↗</a></p></aside>
    <div class="booking-form panel"><noscript><h2>Email works without a form.</h2><p>Send your message to <a href="mailto:omerapoua0@gmail.com">omerapoua0@gmail.com</a>.</p></noscript><form data-enquiry="contact" hidden>
      <div class="form-progress" data-progress><span class="step-label" data-step-label>Step 1 of 2</span><progress value="1" max="2" aria-label="Enquiry progress">1 of 2</progress></div>
      <fieldset class="form-step" data-step><legend tabindex="-1">What brings you here?</legend><p>Choose the closest fit. A good conversation can go somewhere unexpected.</p><div class="choice-grid"><label class="choice-card"><input type="radio" name="topic" value="Project" required /><span class="choice-content"><strong>A project</strong><small>Build something useful together.</small></span></label><label class="choice-card"><input type="radio" name="topic" value="Automation" required /><span class="choice-content"><strong>An automation</strong><small>Make a repeated process work better.</small></span></label><label class="choice-card"><input type="radio" name="topic" value="Research" required /><span class="choice-content"><strong>Research</strong><small>Compare questions and ideas.</small></span></label><label class="choice-card"><input type="radio" name="topic" value="Opportunity" required /><span class="choice-content"><strong>An opportunity</strong><small>A role, collaboration or introduction.</small></span></label><label class="choice-card"><input type="radio" name="topic" value="Hello" required /><span class="choice-content"><strong>Just saying hello</strong><small>That is a good reason too.</small></span></label></div></fieldset>
      <fieldset class="form-step" data-step><legend tabindex="-1">Give me a little context.</legend><div class="field-grid"><label class="field">Your name<input name="name" autocomplete="name" maxlength="80" required /></label><label class="field">Email address<input name="email" type="email" autocomplete="email" maxlength="150" required /></label></div><label class="field">Your message<textarea name="message" rows="6" maxlength="1800" required placeholder="What are you working on, and how might I help?"></textarea></label><p class="notice">Please leave out passwords, private records and other sensitive information. This form prepares an email draft, not a website submission.</p></fieldset>
      <div class="form-actions" data-navigation><button class="button button-secondary" type="button" data-back>← Back</button><button class="button" type="submit" data-next>Continue →</button></div>
      <section class="form-review" data-review hidden aria-labelledby="contact-review-title"><p class="eyebrow">Your message, ready to review</p><h2 id="contact-review-title" tabindex="-1">Let’s get the conversation started.</h2><p><strong>Nothing has been sent.</strong> Open the draft in your email app, check it and press send there.</p><label class="field">Your prepared message<textarea data-draft rows="10" readonly></textarea></label><div class="form-actions"><a class="button" data-email href="mailto:omerapoua0@gmail.com">Open email draft ↗</a><button class="button button-secondary" type="button" data-copy>Copy message</button><button class="button button-secondary" type="button" data-edit>Edit details</button></div><p class="fine-print">If your email app does not open, copy the message and send it to <a href="mailto:omerapoua0@gmail.com">omerapoua0@gmail.com</a>.</p></section>
      <p class="form-status" data-status id="contact-form-status" role="status" aria-live="polite" aria-atomic="true"></p>
    </form></div>
  </section>
  <script>import '../scripts/forms';</script>
</OmarLayout>
